26. FINAL VERIFICATION CONTROL STATEMENT
======================================================================

Stage 3 verification is controlled by evidence rather than by narrative
consistency.

The purpose of this registry is to preserve the previously documented
verification information while preventing unsupported conversion of
reported values into verified computational claims.

The definitive verification status of each item will be updated only when
the underlying computational or source artifact is recovered, inspected,
and linked to the corresponding patient, simulation condition, and
numerical result.

Until then:

DOCUMENTED / REPORTED
does not mean
VERIFIED.

The repository therefore retains a transparent distinction between:

what the model was designed to do,
what was previously reported,
what execution evidence can be recovered,
what can be independently checked,
and what can ultimately support the manuscript.

